1
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:36,000
So you aren't aware
the plague has spread to Yangshu!

2
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,400
Nobody dares step out of their homes.
They're in a panic

3
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:45,000
Yeah, I'd wanted to visit my 3rd aunt
but she discouraged us from doing so

4
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,760
So that was the reason

5
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,600
I'm told the plague
is even more fearful...

6
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:50,760
than wild beasts and flooding

7
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,720
-It might even have come to our town
-Stop scaring us

8
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:59,000
Isn't the girl who was taken ill
outside the Weis' herbal stall...

9
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:02,720
two days ago
a former resident in Yangshu?

10
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:10,000
Isn't it as good as saying
the epidemic has come to roost?

11
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,600
A load of crap!

12
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:16,000
What epidemic when peace
is the order of the day?

13
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,600
Your Excellency,
we're no carriers of the disease

14
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:22,000
How dare you people try to spread
fallacies to create confusion!

15
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:25,760
Our town has the illustrious
Lord Yonghuan holding the reins

16
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:29,720
We have no fear. No demons
or monsters can wreak havoc,

17
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:31,720
never mind this minor epidemic

18
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:36,000
Your Excellency, it may be
a tiny virus but it's virulent!

19
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:39,000
Yes, that was what happened in Yangshu

20
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:43,600
If the disease takes root,
the deaths will be widespread!

21
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:46,760
What's so alarmed
about having a few deaths?

22
00:02:46,760 --> 00:02:51,000
How can you say that?
A death is still a death

23
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:54,720
Moreover, this disease
is highly infectious

24
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:57,720
It will spread from one to another...

25
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:01,720
Your Excellency, you'd better
think of a solution...

26
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:03,400
or many people will die for nothing!

27
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,720
Knock it off! Try saying that again
and I will have you punished!

28
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:10,400
Break it up!
Go home...!

29
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,720
-Did it really happen that way?
-It did

30
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:24,000
I did send a team
to Yangshu to find out

31
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:28,600
Indeed many people did die of
the plague. It may spread to our town

32
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,720
Trust you to be in a state
of constant fluster!

33
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:37,720
-Your Lordship, it's big trouble...
-What's the matter?

34
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:41,000
-The Princess...
-Yes?

35
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,600
She's gone back to the Capital

36
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,400
Who are her escorts?

37
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:48,600
Ma Ruyi, Mei Shouquan,
Wu Fuqi and Wei Delu

38
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:52,000
To think those four persons
could act as her bodyguards!

39
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:56,000
Your Lordship, the bird is pretty

40
00:03:56,000 --> 00:04:00,000
But it'll need a greater effort
to catch it back once it's flown off

41
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:10,000
Yes, if only the cage is sealed,
it'll never be able to fly away

42
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,600
Well said, Your Lordship

43
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:18,400
Shi Yaoqian, did you say the epidemic
would come to Ping'an very soon?

44
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:21,000
I've got it.
I'll do it right away!

45
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,400
Indeed Your Lordship is very smart!

46
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:30,720
My dear, how can you fly away?

47
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:35,760
The gate's closed!

48
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:39,760
The gate's closed when the Princess
is leaving? What's going on?

49
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:43,760
It must be a dark scheme.
Ouyang Xiaotian's behind it?

50
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,760
Edict from His Majesty!

51
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:56,000
An epidemic is ravaging Yangshu

52
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:59,200
As of today, the city will be sealed
to prevent the disease from spreading

53
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:02,000
Nobody is allowed to leave
without permission

54
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:09,600
Your Highness, there is
an epidemic in Yangshu

55
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:12,000
It is a town before the Capital

56
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:13,520
For Your Highness' safety,

57
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:16,720
I ask Your Highness to think twice
and delay the return journey

58
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:21,000
Yes, it's better for Your Highness
to go back to Zizhu Villa

59
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:24,000
Why should I listen to you?
I will not go back

60
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,760
I can delay the departure,

61
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:30,720
but I don't wish to take refuge and be
subjected to the owner's mood swings!

62
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:38,000
Your Highness, if you don't wish
to go back to Zizhu Villa,

63
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,000
you may put up at my humble abode

64
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:43,600
That's right, it's a good idea

65
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:47,600
Delu and I will share the honour
if Your Highness puts up with the Weis

66
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:51,000
Nobody will act nasty
towards Your Highness!

67
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:55,760
How can a princess stay in
a commoner's house? That's an anomaly!

68
00:05:55,760 --> 00:05:58,760
Doesn't His Majesty often remind us
to love the people?

69
00:05:58,760 --> 00:06:01,720
How would you share their sufferings
if you stay away from them?

70
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:04,600
Indeed, by staying with
ordinary folks,

71
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:08,760
Her Highness shows that she understands
the principle of caring for the people

72
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:11,400
Yes, it's well said.
It's wonderful!

73
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:16,720
It's absurd if a princess
doesn't have freedom of movement!

74
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,000
Who will be held accountable...

75
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,600
if the plague worsens
and Her Highness is affected?

76
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:26,000
Who would dare go near the Princess
when Golden Swallow is with her?

77
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:29,600
Golden Swallow, please!

78
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:35,000
Golden Swallow?!

79
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:43,240
Your Highness,
this is bird's nest with honey

80
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:49,760
Your Highness is a royal.
It's good for health and complexion

81
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:52,600
Sir, you shouldn't have prepared
such a lavish spread

82
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:54,720
I just want to eat what you eat

83
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:59,600
Your Highness, you may not be aware
that this is our normal fare

84
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:01,720
Isn't it, Father?

85
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:09,000
Your Highness, the truth is we have
nothing to our credit except money

86
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:15,760
Your Highness,
my son isn't a filial breed

87
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,000
First of all, he has
neither fame nor rank

88
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:20,600
Secondly, he has yet to marry

89
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:26,000
Money is no longer important
as far as I'm concerned

90
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:31,000
It's an honour for my family
to be hosting Your Highness

91
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:35,720
I've followed your instructions and
picked this material for Her Highness

92
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:37,000
Do you think it's good enough?

93
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,400
You may go!

94
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:48,760
Father, there should be another dish.
Care to find out?

95
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:53,000
Father, we tried so hard
to get Her Highness to come here

96
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:55,000
Why did you make it so embarrassing?

97
00:07:55,000 --> 00:08:01,600
I'm trying to get Her Highness
to help you in your career

98
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:03,720
She's feeling awkward instead!

99
00:08:05,760 --> 00:08:09,600
Not so loud. We don't want
our god of wealth to run away!

100
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:16,720
I wonder what I can do to make
the Princess leave as soon as possible

101
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:19,400
What can we do for you?

102
00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:22,760
I'm trying to get the Princess
leave as soon as possible...

103
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:27,600
Don't you love to have the Princess
staying in your place?

104
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:32,760
You're able to get close to her.
Isn't that what you dreamed to have?

105
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:39,720
I fear she may get to like me
more and more

106
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,760
I thought that was your dream

107
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,720
Let me fill you in

108
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:49,000
Her Highness
is like a heavy-weight deity

109
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:51,720
My house is only a tiny temple

110
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:56,720
You know my father is known
for his body odour

111
00:08:56,720 --> 00:09:00,000
The Princess will feel uncomfortable
if he keeps talking

112
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:07,000
Also, our neighbours will come peeping
and making all kinds of comments

113
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:10,720
She will feel rather unsettled

114
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:18,760
I'd like to show my care and concern.
I want her to feel nice and cosy...

115
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:22,720
I see. You feel uncomfortable
when the Princess feels at home!

116
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:26,000
You're a nice man.
You care about her...

117
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:48,000
It can fly!

118
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:52,600
Weren't you very good at flying kites
when you were a boy?

119
00:09:55,760 --> 00:10:00,000
Are you joking or what?
It's made of paper, mind you!

120
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:03,000
Indeed, you're an expert
in making kites

121
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:07,000
I am, but the kites
I make are no bigger than this

122
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:10,760
You want a kite
big enough to carry a person?

123
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:11,760
I do!

124
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:18,000
You will make a huge kite

125
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:25,000
Only the Princess and I will take off
and soar the skies...

126
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:31,000
Do you know how wonderful the feeling
of flying with her is?

127
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:51,600
Go away!
Go away...!

128
00:10:54,760 --> 00:11:00,000
Did I say we'd run out of medicine?
You can do nothing with your money!

129
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:04,000
I've told you to disperse.
Go home, please!

130
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,600
Please make way...

131
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:14,000
We're running a business.
How can you drive them away?

132
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:20,600
-Old Master told me to do it
-Old Master?

133
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:25,000
Yes, Old Master didn't want them
to peep at the Princess

134
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:30,600
I'm not here to peep at the Princess.
I want medicine to save my wife's life

135
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:34,000
Why are you driving us away?
It's as if we didn't have money!

136
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:38,000
Attention, please.
I will sell the herbs

137
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:41,600
But you must maintain order.
You'll come in one at a time

138
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:46,720
-Are you entertaining them?
-Yes, I am

139
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:50,600
-In that case, I'll take my leave
-Hold it

140
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:55,600
You're the physician.
How can I handle so many people?

141
00:11:55,600 --> 00:12:01,600
Engage more people. Young Master,
I'm a physician, not your servant

142
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:12,600
I will sell you the herbs.
But you must follow the queue...

143
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:17,000
Bad news, we have 5 more deaths today!

144
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,600
How did it come to this?

145
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:22,760
Wang Jinba has been having
a high temperature for 5 days!

146
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:28,600
Oh no, his wife came here
a couple of days ago to buy melons

147
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:30,000
I had a nice chat with her

148
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:35,760
-She might spread the disease to you
-She couldn't have...

149
00:12:35,760 --> 00:12:39,000
It was all fear and panic out there

150
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:43,000
I suggest you take a day off
and stay at home

151
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:50,000
Wu Fuqi, since you know
it's chaos and panic out there,

152
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:54,000
you should know better than
to spread rumours and fear!

153
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:58,760
-I'm doing this for your good
-For our good?

154
00:12:58,760 --> 00:13:01,600
We'll go hungry
if we don't work

155
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:04,760
Who will feed and care for us?
You will?

156
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:10,000
Daxi, you weren't born with money and
you won't take it with you when you die

157
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:15,000
Rice is no doubt nice to eat
but money has a greater value

158
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:18,000
However, both can go
if one's survival is at stake

159
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:20,720
I think life is more important
than money

160
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:24,000
Congee may still keep you alive
no matter how poor you are

161
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:28,000
Only a person with such low-esteem
like you may think...

162
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:30,600
congee is good enough
to keep you afloat

163
00:13:30,600 --> 00:13:33,000
I've tasted enough of poverty

164
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:37,000
It's when people are afraid
of opening up for business...

165
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:39,600
that I see the opportunity
to make big money!

166
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:41,000
Shuangxi, let's go

167
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:47,720
If you were to lose your life,
would it be worthwhile?

168
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:49,400
Shut that foul mouth of yours

169
00:13:49,400 --> 00:13:53,000
I'm going to open for business.
Stop standing in my way!

170
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:56,400
Shuangxi, let's go

171
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:04,000
Gold Teeth, what is the latest
in Yangshu Town?

172
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,760
It couldn't have been worse

173
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:10,760
An epidemic has sent the town
strewn with litter and dead bodies

174
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:18,000
The town has barely recovered from
famine. It's truly a double blow!

175
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:22,600
However, a crisis is also an opening

176
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:25,760
Looks like there is big money
to be made

177
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:29,400
Meaning?

178
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:34,000
We can buy more herbs
and keep them away

179
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:39,000
I reckon it's only a matter of time
before they are highly sought after

180
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:42,760
If we raise the price...

181
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:46,720
Isn't that as good as
cashing in on other people's plight?

182
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:51,600
This is a rare opportunity
which comes only once in a lifetime

183
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:54,600
Why don't we make good of it?

184
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:57,000
Fine, it's a good idea

185
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:59,760
Father, never do that

186
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:04,000
Surely you have many ways
of making money

187
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:08,000
You can have any amount of money
once I've passed the exam

188
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:11,000
There is no need to engage
in such unethical practices

189
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:18,000
You passing the exam?
I'm afraid it could be eons away!

190
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:25,000
Don't be rude.
You aren't required at this place!

191
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:33,720
Old Master, I've said
what ought to be said

192
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:37,000
If you miss this great opportunity,

193
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:41,000
please do not accuse me
of not having alerted you

194
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:45,720
Gold Teeth, take it easy.
We can talk it over

195
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:49,600
Fine, do as you've suggested

196
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:55,000
Acquire as much stock as you like.
Are you happy?

197
00:15:55,760 --> 00:15:59,000
-I have your blessings?
-Yes, go and do it

198
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:03,720
Oh deities, please listen to me
wherever you are

199
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:09,000
I beg you to help put the concoction
together. I need it to save lives!

200
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:13,600
Is it ready, Shou?
Jiujin seems to be in pain

201
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:23,600
Jiujin, here is the medicine.
Take it and you'll be well again

202
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,760
Jiujin's running a high fever

203
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:34,600
I fear she may not pull through

204
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:37,600
Let's take her to the physician's

205
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:44,720
Gold Teeth, please get
this prescription ready

206
00:16:44,720 --> 00:16:46,000
I need it to save a life!

207
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,600
We've run out of those items

208
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:05,760
Gold Teeth, please have mercy

209
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:15,760
You're reading this kind of book
when the whole town is gripped by fear

210
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:18,400
This is utterly obscene!

211
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:22,000
I like it. You have the liberty
not to like it

212
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:26,000
There is a plague out there

213
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:29,000
Why didn't we order
more of these items?

214
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:35,000
We're short of these items precisely
because the plague is spreading fast

215
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:42,600
In that case, tell me
where we keep our stocks

216
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:46,720
I've told you they're sold out.
You've the right not to believe me

217
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:22,600
Your father wanted it done this way

218
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:26,000
These are the herbs
for combating the plague

219
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:31,000
Young Master, this is your father's
treasure. You can't touch it

220
00:18:32,760 --> 00:18:34,600
-I can't touch it?
-You can't

221
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:37,000
Do you think I dare not touch it
just because you said so?

222
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:40,000
-You dare push me...
-I'd even beat you up!

223
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:42,000
Stop it!

224
00:18:45,760 --> 00:18:48,000
Lu, what's going on?

225
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:53,600
Father, there is a shortage
of these herbs out there

226
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:55,600
Why are you hoarding them?

227
00:18:57,000 --> 00:19:00,000
The greater the shortage,
the higher the price

228
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:02,000
This is called
hoarding and speculating

229
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:06,760
We can sell these herbs
many times over in Yangshu

230
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:08,760
You should know the logic

231
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:10,760
Hoarding and speculating?

232
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:14,600
Only unscrupulous traders do that

233
00:19:14,600 --> 00:19:18,720
Father, our medicinal shop
is there to treat patients

234
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:23,000
How can you not save lives
when they're facing deaths?

235
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:26,000
How can you talk to your father
in that manner?

236
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:32,000
Father, don't be taken in
by that lowdown of a man!

237
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:37,720
Father, don't let that bit of money
blind you from saving lives

238
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:43,000
You're my son. How come you don't
understand your father's dilemma?

239
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:48,000
Father, what dilemma can you have?

240
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:51,400
What you're after
is people's hard-earned money

241
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:55,760
Lu, you've got it all wrong

242
00:19:56,720 --> 00:20:04,000
I want to raise funds so that you'll
try the imperial exam once again

243
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:10,000
I realized why you were barred
from admission the last time

244
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:12,000
You didn't have enough money

245
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:16,000
We'll present ourselves with tons
of money this time round

246
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:20,000
Let's see who dares stop you
at the entrance

247
00:20:20,600 --> 00:20:23,600
Father, do you know
the kind of situation we're in?

248
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:27,400
Life for the people
is impossible right now

249
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:31,600
Yet you want me
to take the imperial exam?

250
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:37,400
Haven't you been thinking of doing
something for the people?

251
00:20:37,400 --> 00:20:40,400
Only when you have a title
will you be appointed an official

252
00:20:40,400 --> 00:20:44,600
Only when you're an official will you
be able to do good for the people

253
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:47,600
Father, what kind of official
do you want me to be?

254
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:52,000
Do you want me to be like Shi Yaoqian,
wallowing in self-indulgence?

255
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:57,600
Do you want me to be an official
feeding on people's flesh and blood?

256
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:04,600
Did I give you so much education
so that you'd talk to me in this manner?!

257
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:07,000
I'm true to my words

258
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:12,000
I wouldn't want you to use your money
to buy me that so-called title!

259
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:17,000
Why do you keep pitting yourself
against me?

260
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:23,720
Father, I don't do that. I don't go
against you just for the sake of it

261
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:28,000
I'm stating the facts. Our business
will prosper and expand...

262
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:33,000
only when everybody
in Ping'an is in good health

263
00:21:33,600 --> 00:21:37,000
Instead of saving lives
with the herbs you have,

264
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:40,000
you choose to sell them
to people outside Ping'an

265
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:42,600
You're killing the goose
that lays the golden egg

266
00:21:42,600 --> 00:21:45,720
How will people talk about your
reputation and this shop's good name?

267
00:21:45,720 --> 00:21:47,600
Have you thought through all this?

268
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:09,600
Don't you blame me.
I'm only carrying out orders

269
00:22:09,600 --> 00:22:11,400
-Who gave you the orders?
-I did!

270
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:13,600
How have I offended you again?

271
00:22:13,600 --> 00:22:19,000
There is an epidemic out there
yet you keep going out

272
00:22:19,760 --> 00:22:22,600
What if you bring home the disease?

273
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:27,000
Are you trying to snuff me to death
by hanging garlic around my neck?!

274
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:29,600
Garlic keeps epidemics at bay

275
00:22:29,600 --> 00:22:32,760
Don't ever come in to this room
if you don't have garlic!

276
00:22:35,000 --> 00:22:37,600
Are you here to borrow things again?!

277
00:22:38,760 --> 00:22:43,000
The epidemic has affected many people
in my village. I'm afraid...

278
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:48,720
-So are you moving in to our place?
-I just need a bed

279
00:22:50,600 --> 00:22:52,000
Fat hope - no way!

280
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:57,600
Please be more sympathetic. You won't
want him to die of the plague, will you?

281
00:22:59,760 --> 00:23:02,000
You can't possibly ask him
to live off us

282
00:23:02,000 --> 00:23:06,720
Don't blame me for not alerting you
if you get hoodwinked by him!

283
00:23:07,600 --> 00:23:10,600
-I like it!
-Delirium!

284
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:17,720
-Wow, garlic with rice, eh?
-That's right

285
00:23:17,720 --> 00:23:21,600
Shut up if you don't like eating it.
Otherwise, feel free to join us

286
00:23:21,600 --> 00:23:24,000
That's the last thing I want to eat.
I'm going out!

287
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:30,600
So you'd know better than
to deprive your son of good food

288
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:36,400
I'm telling you to open
one half of the door

289
00:23:36,400 --> 00:23:38,600
I don't want the evil air to sneak in!

290
00:23:38,600 --> 00:23:40,400
And wear this when you come back!

291
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:02,600
My house has a door, mind you!

292
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:07,000
I don't want your ma to see me.
What are you doing?

293
00:24:07,600 --> 00:24:12,600
My mother is so scared of contracting
the disease! She is crazy!

294
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:17,600
I happened to have come here
because of the epidemic

295
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:21,600
I intend to break into
my father's warehouse...

296
00:24:21,600 --> 00:24:23,720
and distribute the herbs
to save lives

297
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,000
Will you help me?

298
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:35,000
Stealing from your own father's -
don't you fear retribution?

299
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:42,600
We're trying to save lives.
Will you or not?

300
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:46,600
You'll face retribution.
But I'll go with you!

301
00:25:08,720 --> 00:25:11,000
I'll open the door.
You'll keep a lookout

302
00:25:15,760 --> 00:25:18,000
-Why did you hit me?
-You hit me, rather!

303
00:25:23,600 --> 00:25:27,000
Some buddies you are.
Why didn't you rope me in?

304
00:25:29,000 --> 00:25:31,760
-Who told you we came here?
-Your mother

305
00:25:32,600 --> 00:25:36,000
She was afraid you guys might
land yourselves in the soup

306
00:25:36,600 --> 00:25:40,000
I didn't want to get you
involved in this venture

307
00:25:41,000 --> 00:25:43,600
Trust you to have said
we're a three-in-one team...

308
00:25:43,600 --> 00:25:47,000
and that we'll share weal and woe

309
00:25:47,600 --> 00:25:51,600
You've forgotten all that vow.
You didn't even keep me posted

310
00:25:51,600 --> 00:25:54,600
Jiujin needs the medicine,
if not the people in Ping'an

311
00:25:54,600 --> 00:25:56,600
I can't wait to save more lives...

312
00:25:57,000 --> 00:26:00,000
We'd better go. We'll be done for
if we're discovered

313
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:03,400
Why did you hit me?

314
00:26:03,400 --> 00:26:06,720
I asked you to keep a lookout
yet you didn't even know he was around!

315
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:08,720
Don't tell me you knew!

316
00:26:08,720 --> 00:26:14,000
He is so sickly that he goes about
like a spirit. What's new about that?

317
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:16,000
My spirit even hops!

318
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:19,600
-Let's stop talking
-We'd better go...

319
00:26:24,600 --> 00:26:27,000
Wow, so many of them!

320
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:35,000
They've hoarded so much of them.
This is totally callous!

321
00:26:35,000 --> 00:26:36,600
But that's your father

322
00:26:36,600 --> 00:26:41,000
Kinship doesn't come into play.
My father's too much!

323
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:58,600
Hold it! Hold it...!

324
00:27:02,000 --> 00:27:05,000
You're the bad company
he mixes with!

325
00:27:11,000 --> 00:27:15,600
Please do not get so worked up.
You'll get a stroke!

326
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:17,720
I'll beat the hell out of you!

327
00:27:17,720 --> 00:27:18,720
Stop it!

328
00:27:21,000 --> 00:27:22,600
What's going on?

329
00:27:22,600 --> 00:27:27,600
I heard your shouts and screams
from far away. What's all this about?

330
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:30,000
Your Excellency,
you're the right person

331
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:33,400
These two guys sneaked into my warehouse
and stole these bags of herbs

332
00:27:33,400 --> 00:27:35,760
This is hard evidence.
I want to take them to court!

333
00:27:35,760 --> 00:27:37,000
-Who?
-Them!

334
00:27:41,760 --> 00:27:45,000
Wei Delu, trust you to have ganged up
with Wu Fuqi and Mei Shouquan...

335
00:27:45,000 --> 00:27:46,400
to steal from your family's warehouse

336
00:27:46,400 --> 00:27:47,760
Do you plead guilty?

337
00:27:47,760 --> 00:27:53,000
Your Excellency, I took the initiative
to involve Wu Fuqi and Mei Shouquan

338
00:27:53,600 --> 00:27:57,720
They knew nothing about my plan
to break into the warehouse

339
00:27:58,600 --> 00:28:01,000
In other words, you're the culprit!

340
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:04,000
Lu, why did you absorb all the blame.
They...

341
00:28:04,400 --> 00:28:07,600
Lu, didn't we say we're
a three-in-one team? Why did you...

342
00:28:07,600 --> 00:28:09,000
Yes, we should work as one

343
00:28:12,760 --> 00:28:15,760
Your Excellency, please hear me out

344
00:28:15,760 --> 00:28:18,600
The Wei's herbal shop
belongs to our family

345
00:28:18,600 --> 00:28:24,600
As the eldest son of the Wei family,
I witnessed the plague spreading fast

346
00:28:24,600 --> 00:28:29,000
I therefore decided to save lives
with the herbs in our warehouse

347
00:28:29,000 --> 00:28:32,000
May I know
what crime have I committed?

348
00:28:32,000 --> 00:28:35,000
Whenever the Yellow River
causes massive flooding,

349
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:38,000
the government would also mount
a rescue effort with its reserves

350
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:43,000
May I know if His Majesty
is also a thief?

351
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:47,000
The rescue effort isn't stealing but
your doing it without permission is!

352
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:51,000
Did you get your father's permission
to help yourself with the herbs?

353
00:28:51,000 --> 00:28:55,600
Indeed I've not had my father's consent
before handing out the herbs

354
00:28:55,600 --> 00:28:57,720
Since he is my father,
it becomes a family matter

355
00:28:57,720 --> 00:29:00,720
The place to solve this problem is
in the family, not a court, isn't it?

356
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:06,000
I didn't commit a crime of stealing,
did I?

357
00:29:06,600 --> 00:29:11,000
My father is wrong
to have resorted to hoarding

358
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:14,000
But that is another form
of doing business

359
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:16,720
According to an old saying...

360
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:19,600
Wei Delu,
stop quoting the classics to me!

361
00:29:19,600 --> 00:29:23,000
Your father resorted to hoarding
to jack up prices

362
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:27,600
The least it can do is to cause
inflation and disrupt the local economy

363
00:29:27,600 --> 00:29:30,600
Worse still, it could lead
to fear and confusion!

364
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:36,600
Your Excellency, this is a game of
criminalizing a person and hanging him

365
00:29:37,720 --> 00:29:40,000
Your Excellency,
please do not put me behind bars

366
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:42,600
I fear darkness and rats

367
00:29:43,600 --> 00:29:47,720
I am willing to pay a fine to make up
for the losses the town has suffered

368
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:50,600
Your Excellency,
please show mercy

369
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:55,600
I will forgive you
on account of your expressed sincerity

370
00:29:55,600 --> 00:29:59,720
Didn't you offer to pay a fine?
We can negotiate the terms

371
00:29:59,720 --> 00:30:03,000
Deliver two barrels of gold tangerines
and a basket of gold watermelons,

372
00:30:03,000 --> 00:30:05,000
I will pardon your crime

373
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:08,600
This is like looting in a crisis

374
00:30:09,000 --> 00:30:12,600
Father, ignore him. Justice
is in the hearts of those involved

375
00:30:12,600 --> 00:30:15,600
I don't believe he has the power
to lord it over us

376
00:30:17,000 --> 00:30:20,000
Stay there! You can't go
when this trial isn't over yet!

377
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:23,600
Are you conducting a trial?
You're blackmailing us!

378
00:30:28,000 --> 00:30:29,600
Your Highness!

379
00:30:39,760 --> 00:30:41,600
Stop getting yourselves entangled
in this herbal case

380
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:44,000
I came to solve this problem too

381
00:30:44,720 --> 00:30:47,600
The Weis were wrong
to have kept the herbs away

382
00:30:47,600 --> 00:30:49,600
But it wasn't a criminal offence

383
00:30:49,600 --> 00:30:52,000
The Weis shouldn't be making
a loss either

384
00:30:52,000 --> 00:30:55,600
I will buy over all the herbs
with 100 taels of gold

385
00:30:55,600 --> 00:30:59,600
You'll distribute them to everybody.
That's the end of this case. Agree?

386
00:31:00,400 --> 00:31:02,000
Thank you, Your Highness!

387
00:31:03,600 --> 00:31:06,000
Son, why haven't you turned in?

388
00:31:07,000 --> 00:31:10,400
I'm almost done.
You needn't worry about me

389
00:31:11,600 --> 00:31:16,000
What's going on? I've been seeing you
fiddling with these things here

390
00:31:17,000 --> 00:31:20,400
-I'm having fun, actually
-Having fun?

391
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:27,600
You should have more sleep instead.
You'd better not fall ill again

392
00:31:27,600 --> 00:31:30,000
Point taken.
I'll turn in the moment it's done

393
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:34,600
-Please go to bed, Mother
-Don't wear yourself out, OK?

394
00:31:34,600 --> 00:31:37,000
I know what to do. Please go on

395
00:31:39,760 --> 00:31:41,000
Good night!

396
00:31:48,000 --> 00:31:50,600
There is no lack of lanterns
with a thousand eyes;

397
00:31:50,600 --> 00:31:53,000
what's lacking is candles
with a single wick

398
00:31:54,000 --> 00:31:59,000
Lu, I assure you I will hand this kite
to you before daybreak

399
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:19,000
Wei Delu, you seemed so pious.
What were you praying for?

400
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:25,000
I asked Deity Chenghuang
to let me fly

401
00:32:26,760 --> 00:32:28,000
Fly?

402
00:32:29,760 --> 00:32:32,000
-What kind of joke is this?
-I'm not joking

403
00:32:32,600 --> 00:32:36,000
I'm making preparations.
I'd like to ask Your Highness...

404
00:32:37,720 --> 00:32:41,000
if you're willing to come with me

405
00:32:43,000 --> 00:32:47,000
I ever dreamt of myself
being a bird soaring the skies

406
00:32:48,760 --> 00:32:53,000
-Are you able to fly?
-Of course, straight to the Capital

407
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:56,600
No medley of people
dotting the journey

408
00:32:56,600 --> 00:33:00,600
We'll only see the blue sky and white
clouds, and trouble-free birds

409
00:33:01,600 --> 00:33:04,000
The sky is our home!

410
00:33:04,760 --> 00:33:08,600
-Are you having me on?
-Or course, I'm not

411
00:33:09,000 --> 00:33:15,000
I've long noticed that this place
isn't Your Highness' usual habitat

412
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:20,000
Not true. I'd like to go home
because I missed my father

413
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:25,720
As soon as possible just to stay away
from my father's nagging...

414
00:33:25,720 --> 00:33:32,600
and those prying neighbours
who are such a nuisance

415
00:33:35,000 --> 00:33:39,760
However, what matters is that Lord
Yonghuan should know nothing about it

416
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:42,400
-I don't want him to be my escort
-You're right

417
00:33:42,400 --> 00:33:48,000
Contrary to his wish,
I will take you home as soon as I can

418
00:33:48,760 --> 00:33:51,000
So you came up with the idea
of "flying" home?

419
00:33:53,760 --> 00:33:56,600
-Do you have what it takes to do that?
-Of course, I do

420
00:33:56,600 --> 00:34:05,000
We may not have wings,
but we do have...a smart brain

421
00:34:05,760 --> 00:34:07,400
What can you come up with?

422
00:34:07,400 --> 00:34:11,000
Do you know that Shou is an expert
in making kites?

423
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:15,000
Are you suggesting
we will leave this town on a kite?

424
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:18,600
Lord Yonghuan has the power
to seal the gate of this town

425
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:26,600
-Can he do the same with the sky?
-That's great

426
00:34:26,600 --> 00:34:30,000
He will die of fury
if we're able to fly out

427
00:34:32,000 --> 00:34:34,600
-Is it safe?
-No problem, Your Highness

428
00:34:35,000 --> 00:34:40,720
-It all depends on your wish
-No problem

429
00:34:44,000 --> 00:34:47,600
To think Shouquan could make
such a big kite singlehandedly!

430
00:34:47,600 --> 00:34:50,600
-Are you sure this thing is safe?
-Shut up

431
00:34:50,600 --> 00:34:53,600
Fuqi will hand you a giant slap
if he hears of it

432
00:34:53,600 --> 00:34:55,600
-Can't I make a comment?
-You can't

433
00:34:55,600 --> 00:34:59,000
You shouldn't undermine both Delu's
and Her Highness' confidence

434
00:34:59,000 --> 00:35:01,720
-In case...
-Shut up!

435
00:35:07,000 --> 00:35:13,600
Ladies and gentlemen, the Princess is
giving out free herbs to one and all

436
00:35:14,600 --> 00:35:19,720
This is a charitable handout.
Please queue up if you need some

437
00:35:20,600 --> 00:35:26,000
The medicine to counter the plague -
it's free of charge

438
00:35:34,000 --> 00:35:38,000
Tell me why there are only the two
of you. Why isn't Lu with you?

439
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:39,600
Lu's left with Her Highness

440
00:35:41,600 --> 00:35:43,600
What am I supposed to do then?

441
00:35:44,000 --> 00:35:49,000
Lu did ask me to take good care of you.
Not to worry

442
00:35:49,000 --> 00:35:50,000
You?

443
00:35:50,600 --> 00:35:52,400
-Me, too
-And you?

444
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:56,000
Your Excellency!

445
00:35:58,000 --> 00:36:02,000
-What are you doing here?
-This is a little something from me

446
00:36:02,000 --> 00:36:06,000
Your Excellency should have more of it
since you work so hard every day

447
00:36:06,000 --> 00:36:10,600
It'll cure illnesses, strengthen your
constitution and keep epidemics out!

448
00:36:11,600 --> 00:36:15,000
-Is it so effective?
-You bet!

449
00:36:16,600 --> 00:36:18,600
In that case, thank you very much

450
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:31,600
-Remember we've met before?
-Wu Fuqi and he is Mei Shouquan

451
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:36,000
I suggest you pack off early
and go home!

452
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:42,600
All right. We'll heed Your Excellency's
advice and have an early night!

453
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:45,760
How come they're not here yet?

454
00:36:47,400 --> 00:36:50,600
-Could something have happened to them?
-It couldn't

455
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:56,000
Fu and Shou know the importance and
clandestine nature of this operation

456
00:36:56,000 --> 00:36:59,000
Let's be more patient, OK?

457
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:03,600
Master Wei, are you sure
we can take off just like that?

458
00:37:03,600 --> 00:37:09,000
Of course, we can. But we need
a bit of wind from the east

459
00:37:09,720 --> 00:37:13,600
-You know the wind directions?
-Sort of

460
00:37:13,600 --> 00:37:16,600
I did a check before we came out

461
00:37:16,600 --> 00:37:19,600
We'll have the southeast wind
blowing after 12 midnight

462
00:37:19,600 --> 00:37:22,720
It's just the right kind of wind
to lift the kite up

463
00:37:22,720 --> 00:37:26,000
-How did you do the check?
-How did I do it?

464
00:37:27,600 --> 00:37:31,720
I'm not telling you. Trust me
to have come up with a brilliant idea

465
00:37:31,720 --> 00:37:36,000
Trust you to be wallowing in that
small achievement of yours

466
00:37:36,600 --> 00:37:38,400
Please don't say that, Your Highness

467
00:37:38,400 --> 00:37:41,000
Don't you see
we have a half moon today?

468
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:45,600
This is the time
the southeast wind starts blowing

469
00:37:45,600 --> 00:37:49,600
We'll be like immortals
flying in the sky...

470
00:37:55,000 --> 00:38:00,600
Don't you get nervous. You'll have
more problems if you're fazed, get it?

471
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:04,000
I do. I understand

472
00:38:07,000 --> 00:38:10,000
If you see the guards charging at us,
you will...

473
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:11,000
Yes?

474
00:38:12,000 --> 00:38:15,000
-Stay firm like a rock
-Stay firm?

475
00:38:15,760 --> 00:38:19,000
Nobody dares touch Golden Swallow
if she moves not an inch

476
00:38:19,720 --> 00:38:21,000
If they come at me, I will...

477
00:38:21,000 --> 00:38:24,600
The more you move,
the more you'll give yourself away

478
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:29,600
What took them so long?

479
00:38:31,000 --> 00:38:35,000
-Didn't you say be patient?
-We may miss the hour

480
00:38:36,600 --> 00:38:40,600
-What if we miss the hour?
-The wind will change directions

481
00:38:41,000 --> 00:38:46,000
-What'll happen if it changes directions?
-It may not be conducive to our take-off

482
00:38:47,000 --> 00:38:50,000
-What will happen then?
-Accidents can happen

483
00:38:54,720 --> 00:38:56,600
It's all right, Your Highness

484
00:38:57,000 --> 00:39:03,600
You'll have more problems if you're
fazed. You'll be absolutely fine

485
00:39:05,000 --> 00:39:07,000
I know. I understand...

486
00:39:16,600 --> 00:39:18,600
We told you to shut up!

487
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:21,600
We'll hold you accountable
should anything bad happen!

488
00:39:22,760 --> 00:39:23,760
Stay there...!

489
00:40:00,600 --> 00:40:02,400
Gongxi facai!

490
00:40:06,720 --> 00:40:08,600
After them...!

491
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:16,000
-Golden Swallow!
-Leave this place to me!

492
00:40:18,720 --> 00:40:20,000
Scram!

493
00:41:05,000 --> 00:41:09,000
-Where are we?
-Must be up in the sky

494
00:41:11,480 --> 00:41:14,000
-Are you okay?
-I am fine

495
00:41:19,760 --> 00:41:22,000
Fear not - just cling on to me

496
00:41:31,000 --> 00:41:34,720
Rest assured I, Wei Delu,
is a gentleman

497
00:41:35,000 --> 00:41:38,760
-I will not take advantage of you
-I understand

498
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:41,000
The wind is blowing in our favour

499
00:41:44,000 --> 00:41:46,400
The feeling of wind is also excellent

500
00:41:48,760 --> 00:41:51,000
It's working in our favour

501
00:41:52,760 --> 00:41:54,000
We'll have a smooth journey

502
00:41:57,000 --> 00:41:59,600
Your Highness,
why do you keep nodding?

503
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:04,760
-Wei Delu, my life is in your hands!
-Don't you worry

504
00:42:09,000 --> 00:42:13,600
I never got an opportunity
to fly a kite when I was a boy

505
00:42:14,000 --> 00:42:20,000
I used to dream myself
like a huge kite soaring the skies

506
00:42:20,000 --> 00:42:24,000
Your Highness, I must thank you
for making my dream come true

507
00:42:24,000 --> 00:42:26,600
-What has it got to do with me?
-Of course it has

508
00:42:26,600 --> 00:42:32,200
I wouldn't have left Ping'an
and flown on such a huge kite

509
00:42:32,200 --> 00:42:36,600
You have a point there. In that case,
how will you reciprocate in kind?

510
00:42:36,600 --> 00:42:38,720
I have no means of reciprocating

511
00:42:39,000 --> 00:42:43,000
The only thing I can do is place myself
at Your Highness' service all my life

512
00:42:44,000 --> 00:42:45,720
That's very kind of you

513
00:42:47,000 --> 00:42:50,600
Do you know
how many stars there are?

514
00:42:52,000 --> 00:42:55,600
Your Highness, you got me

515
00:42:57,760 --> 00:43:03,000
1...2...3...4...

516
00:43:06,000 --> 00:43:08,760
Why did you stop counting?

517
00:43:10,720 --> 00:43:12,600
Did you see those three stars?

518
00:43:13,000 --> 00:43:16,600
You means those three stars
slightly dimmer?

519
00:43:17,600 --> 00:43:19,600
Father says those are the three stars...

520
00:43:19,600 --> 00:43:23,000
deciding fortunes, prosperity
and longevity in the mortal world

521
00:43:24,000 --> 00:43:25,760
They've become so dim

522
00:43:27,000 --> 00:43:30,000
To bring Ping'an Town back
to its former tranquillity,

523
00:43:30,600 --> 00:43:33,000
I doubt it's going to be
as easy as we think

524
00:43:34,000 --> 00:43:38,000
Your Highness,
haven't you heard of this saying?

525
00:43:39,000 --> 00:43:42,000
Where hills bend, steams wind
and the pathway seems to end,

526
00:43:42,000 --> 00:43:44,600
past dark willows and flowers
in bloom lies another village

527
00:43:44,600 --> 00:43:50,720
Once we get to the Capital and you tell
your father what Ouyang Xiaotian...

528
00:43:50,720 --> 00:43:56,000
has done, our Ping'an town will turn
a crisis into an opportunity

529
00:43:56,000 --> 00:43:58,000
May Heaven answer our prayers

530
00:43:58,600 --> 00:44:02,760
I will feel more than gratified
if peace prevails in Ping'an

531
00:44:03,600 --> 00:44:07,000
Actually, things can turn around
in the most unexpected way

532
00:44:08,000 --> 00:44:12,600
I feel more than gratified
being able to stay with Your Highness

533
00:44:30,000 --> 00:44:35,000
-What's going on?
-Nothing. It's just a turbulence

534
00:44:46,000 --> 00:44:47,600
Hold tight!

535
00:44:51,000 --> 00:44:52,760
Cling on to me!

536
00:44:58,000 --> 00:44:59,080
Subtitles: H Yap


